        <groundspeak:log id="619228974">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-07-11T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="946600">Black Shark</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP634 Smoky Lake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sigh...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After finding a physical cache just outside of Smoky Lake we were checking to see what was next...and realized that we had managed to drive right past not one but two brass caps.  They were on our list and in the GPS, yet we missed them.  At one point we needed a stop to stretch our legs and get the circulation going so we walked part of the Iron Horse Trail.  It was pleasant enough and served the purpose but it would have been more fun to stop for a couple of caps.   However, they were now 45 - 60 km behind us.  We're just going to write that off as mega event fatigue.  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_sleepy.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This cap was next on the horizon and we weren't going to pass it up!   We wandered a moment on the grass before Mr Shark found it with his foot.  Smokey Lake not only has giant pumpkins, but a unique brass cap &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; a castle, which we were off to see next!  Good lasagna, too!  Thanks for another cap that brought us back to a place we have not been for a long time, ofth.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683274436">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-06-04T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="14081052">cailloupot</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP634 Smokey Lakes

Out for a 24hours blitz of caching and we came discover this one along the way. Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="607613063">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-06-04T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3764584">Ninja Fairies</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP-634 Smoky Lake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Found with Team 7Up which is me, cailloupot, Boombear, Kiwibirdman, fuzeebear, WillowZilla, and  SigShark. We were on a 24 hour caching run to the Cold Lake area and we stopped here to top up on gas since there's a shortage on right now. WillowZilla has been giving us bras cap updates as we drive and as we were so close, the group acquiesced and we came to find this. It wasn't an easy find, but Kiwibirdman noticed a telltale sign and soon he had uncovered it. WillowZilla has forwarded the cap information and pic.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
      </groundspeak:logs>
